MarketWeave adapts the pmxt implementation while retaining package, SDK,
protocol and venue interfaces. Source: https://github.com/pmxt-dev/pmxt
Reference release: v2.17.1, commit 60bdabd5b4484778afe614f15890c438dd083e1b.

The upstream MIT notices at this revision name pmxt.dev for the root source
and qoery.com for the core. These notices are retained respectively in
LICENSE and core/LICENSE, alongside the MarketWeave addition notice.
MarketWeave is an independent derivative, not an upstream pmxt release.
